# Unreal Engine 5 - Large binary directories (CRITICAL: exclude)
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Plugins/*/Binaries/
Plugins/*/Intermediate/

# Unreal Engine binary asset formats (large / not human-readable)
*.pak
*.uasset
*.umap
*.ubulk
*.uptnl

# Unreal Engine compiled shaders
*.ushaderbytecode
*.ushadercode

# Unreal Engine VS project files (auto-generated)
*.sln
*.suo
*.user
*.opensdf
*.sdf
.vs/
VisualStudioVersion.txt

# FBX / 3D model source files (large)
*.fbx
*.obj
*.dae

# CUDA compiled
*.o
*.ptx
*.cubin
*.so
*.a

# Build artifacts
*.dll
*.exe
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb

# Logs
*.log
Saved/Logs/
Saved/Crashes/
Saved/Backup/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Config overrides (keep Config/ tracked for project settings)
# Saved/Config/ - excluded via Saved/ above

# Note: Keep tracked:
# - Source/ (C++ source code)
# - Config/DefaultEngine.ini, DefaultGame.ini etc.
# - *.uproject (project descriptor)
# - *.usf (shader source files)
# - *.cu (CUDA source)
# - *.cpp, *.h (C++ source)
